@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : registerAccount(name, email, password)
activate System

note right of System: The system validates input fields\nand registers the user in RestDB.

alt Valid Input & Network Success
    System --> User : displays account created success message and returns to Login
else Missing Fields / Network Error
    System --> User : displays error feedback message (Toast)
end

deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
